  "updated": "2026-10-23",
  "how": [
    "You pick a starting operative at the start of each Personal Timeline. Each operative has a starter investigation that unlocks a sleeve and opens a second one: Steel and Analysis → Guardian → To Serve and Protect → Vanguard (Mariko Sato); Field Work Protocol → Pulse → Bulwark on the Frontline → Bulwark (Genevieve Brennan); Rock of Solitude → Rock → Predator's Trail (Kwame Mensah); The Price of Progress → Fugitive → Strategist Protocol → Fuse (Joris van Dijk).",
    "Other operatives' starter chains open after you complete a Monolith Cycle, and finishing a cycle lets you pick a new default sleeve.",
    "Most later sleeves come from Journey of Consciousness investigations that unlock at a Monolith level and cost tokens to start.",
    "Raids with Provided (rental) Equipment don't count toward investigation progress, so use your own gear.",
    "Locked sleeves still show their full stats on the select screen, so you can plan before spending tokens.",
    "Plate slots are torso / hands / legs. XL torso sleeves trade −10% jump and −5% move speed for an XL torso plate."
  ],
